== Logical Plan ==
Project: [#s.id, #c.name]
  Filter: (#s.amount > 10)
    HashJoin: Inner on [#s.customer_id = #c.id]
      Scan: sales
      Scan: customers

== Optimized Logical Plan ==
Project: [#s.id, #c.name]
  Filter: (#s.amount > 10)
    HashJoin: Inner on [#s.customer_id = #c.id]
      Scan: sales
      Scan: customers

== Physical Plan ==
ProjectionExec#0: [#s.id, #c.name]
  FilterExec#1: (#s.amount > 10)
    HashJoinExec#2: Inner [#s.customer_id = #c.id]
      Parquet/Csv/MemoryScanExec#3: sales partitions=1 projection=None
      Parquet/Csv/MemoryScanExec#4: customers partitions=1 projection=None
